<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue between the Viv Ansanm gangs and Haitian security forces, now reinforced by a Kenya led multinational mission, in Port Au Prince and Kenscoff, while the police high command meets departmental directors. The Dominican army has supplied large ammunition stocks to the 400 Mawozo gang, increasing its firepower. Taiwan has offered security experience sharing with Haiti and a U S missionary was arrested on child sex abuse allegations. The Haitian electoral council dropped a rule barring candidates sanctioned by foreign countries. The UCDP recorded 193 battle related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1PSDNZYklwbFlURFR4ZWw5TXBzM2kxUUV5SEZfZHFESFdkUVU2Q2tKUHZJSzBNeFNGZmlfTUQtb0pzaFJZNllRRjNMajF1RkJBdkNkcGF4aHVabFF4TzNteUhEQWVsazkxMnhJeFdSZVZfekluWW8xZjJSX2VYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;lenouvelliste.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE8wM0RuNkMxYnczYkN0Y1RtSU9nY2pwWHU0UWo3b3RaZlRVYlhPdUJGZEtsQ1JMS3BNTF9ucG9oZEF3RDJlQ0RRcU1EeWUyVDZEdnhzc0J1ajkxSFp0RTB2TU1NVGJGU1dDMXVncHlKRWFMZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;HaitiLibre.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQWTdia2tGdXJsT1pRWHVNVzUxM2dpNGFBNjQtdUN5Si1fdVhYVV9ILWJEN3dpcnJhZ2psWUo0T2VGUU1WMm40Y0dOaWlKOUJHcUxJbHBCbExBTjlmLW5LZFR2NUg0RzduNk1kZHhnLWJHNWttdzJZYXYwQWdXcmhFUkZOV1VaWmhKYmRNb05OY1UtcEhNT1FtYnNNc2FoTVU3TXQ4dGp4NnNpM2FibzVxdQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;HaitiLibre.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTFBPWHNPRTVPcHhmS05CQjU5SmQ5eHRCbjMyT1JCM1FscEc4TllBTW05YTllM1MtaXNtNUdnVW5MUWpEV19VWjgwT19aOXhicS1haWhjc3JPdVYyMVd1LURmbU9wbG